   ],
   "reason": "These are paired-end Omni-ATAC (Tn5 tagmentation) genomic libraries from human K562 cells, with two DMSO and two JQ1 replicates, so atacseq can call open chromatin and test accessibility between treated and untreated cells; ATAC references still need staging on Luria before the run.",
